# Lightning McQueen (Rookie pose), converted from McQueen_Rookie_Pose.fbx
# LEFT-HANDED, RenderMan convention: x right, y up, +z into the screen. Units: meters.
# Tires rest on y = 0, car centered at x = 0, nose toward -z (faces a camera looking down +z).
# Viewers that assume a right-handed OBJ (Blender, MeshLab) will show it mirrored. That is expected.
# Triangles only. Every face corner uses one index for v, vt, and vn (already unwelded).
# Texture coordinates: t = 0 is the BOTTOM row of the image (OBJ convention). Tire uvs fall outside [0,1]: wrap.
mtllib mcqueen.mtl

